{"seq":37,"slug":"modern-platform-economics","title":"平台经济学","stage":"DONE","category":"economics-finance","chapterCount":4,"docCount":12,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/economics-finance/modern-platform-economics","rating":{"composite":4.21,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":3.8,"coverage":4,"positioning":4.5,"strategic":4.67},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":null},"introHtml":"<h1 id=\"平台经济学\">平台经济学</h1><p>平台经济学研究双边（或多边）市场中间人如何创造价值、如何定价、如何竞争，以及监管者应以何种工具介入。与传统企业理论中的&quot;买低卖高&quot;不同，平台的核心命题在于：它不生产商品，而是撮合两侧用户的互动，并从网络效应的正反馈中攫取价值。这一特性使得市场结构、价格策略与竞争法则都需要被重新推导。</p>\n<p>本 hub 分为四个章节。第一章「基础理论」建立分析框架：双边市场的定义与判别、网络效应的形成与衰减机制、平台商业模式的分类学。第二章「定价与机制设计」深入平台运营者最核心的决策空间：如何在两侧之间分配成本与收益、如何设计匹配算法、如何构建声誉系统以降低信息摩擦。第三章「竞争与监管」分析平台市场的结构性倾向——赢家通吃与市场临界点、全球反垄断执法的新实践（包括 EU DMA 2024-2026 执法与中国 2025-2026 平台监管）、数据可携与互操作义务。第四章「新兴模式」追踪正在重塑平台边界的三股力量：零工经济的劳动关系再定义、创作者经济平台的分成博弈、以及 AI 时代的平台经济学（GPT Store、MCP 生态等）。</p>\n<p>建议的学习路径：先完成第一章建立理论框架，然后根据兴趣选择第二或第三章深入，最后以第四章的前沿案例检验理论的解释力。前置知识包括微观经济学中的价格理论与博弈论基础。</p>\n<p>本 hub 与同 category 下的其他 hub 存在明确分工：<a href=\"../game-theory/\">博弈论</a>提供策略互动的数学工具，本 hub 消费这些工具来分析平台参与者行为；<a href=\"../information-economics/\">信息经济学</a>聚焦信息不对称与信号理论，本 hub 仅在声誉系统章节涉及其应用；<a href=\"../industrial-organization/\">产业组织</a>覆盖一般性市场结构理论，本 hub 聚焦于平台这一特定市场结构的经济学；<a href=\"../market-design-mechanism-design/\">市场设计与机制设计</a>提供拍卖与匹配理论的形式化框架，本 hub 在匹配机制设计章节引用其结论。</p>\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"foundations","title":"基础理论","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/economics-finance/modern-platform-economics/foundations","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"two-sided-markets","title":"双边市场理论","url":"/l-doc-books/h/economics-finance/modern-platform-economics/foundations/two-sided-markets"},{"seq":2,"slug":"network-effects-dynamics","title":"网络效应与动态","url":"/l-doc-books/h/economics-finance/modern-platform-economics/foundations/network-effects-dynamics"},{"seq":3,"slug":"platform-business-models","title":"平台商业模式","url":"/l-doc-books/h/economics-finance/modern-platform-economics/foundations/platform-business-models"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"pricing-strategy","title":"定价与机制设计","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/economics-finance/modern-platform-economics/pricing-strategy","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"platform-pricing-subsidies","title":"平台定价与补贴策略","url":"/l-doc-books/h/economics-finance/modern-platform-economics/pricing-strategy/platform-pricing-subsidies"},{"seq":2,"slug":"matching-mechanism-design","title":"匹配与机制设计","url":"/l-doc-books/h/economics-finance/modern-platform-economics/pricing-strategy/matching-mechanism-design"},{"seq":3,"slug":"reputation-trust-systems","title":"声誉与信任体系","url":"/l-doc-books/h/economics-finance/modern-platform-economics/pricing-strategy/reputation-trust-systems"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"competition-regulation","title":"竞争与监管","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/economics-finance/modern-platform-economics/competition-regulation","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"winner-take-all-tipping","title":"赢家通吃与临界点","url":"/l-doc-books/h/economics-finance/modern-platform-economics/competition-regulation/winner-take-all-tipping"},{"seq":2,"slug":"platform-antitrust","title":"平台反垄断经济学","url":"/l-doc-books/h/economics-finance/modern-platform-economics/competition-regulation/platform-antitrust"},{"seq":3,"slug":"data-portability-interop","title":"数据可携与互操作","url":"/l-doc-books/h/economics-finance/modern-platform-economics/competition-regulation/data-portability-interop"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"emerging-models","title":"新兴模式","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/economics-finance/modern-platform-economics/emerging-models","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"gig-economy-labor","title":"零工经济与劳动","url":"/l-doc-books/h/economics-finance/modern-platform-economics/emerging-models/gig-economy-labor"},{"seq":2,"slug":"creator-economy-platforms","title":"创作者经济平台","url":"/l-doc-books/h/economics-finance/modern-platform-economics/emerging-models/creator-economy-platforms"},{"seq":3,"slug":"ai-platform-economics","title":"AI 平台经济学","url":"/l-doc-books/h/economics-finance/modern-platform-economics/emerging-models/ai-platform-economics"}]}]}